B.aeB=new A.e5("C6","Wrist extensors (ECRL, ECRB), supinator, clavicular pectoralis.","Mod-independent (tenodesis grasp). 16% full independence rate.","CG to mod-ind UE. Max assist LE. 13% independent UE dressing.","CG to mod-ind with sliding board on level surfaces. 6% independent.","Independent manual WC flat/slight inclines. Power for distance. 88% WC independence.","Independent CIC with adaptive equipment (some). 3% independent bowel.","FIM 45-75",B.Ut,"Mod-Independence (highest complete SCI for independent living)",0,"TENODESIS GRASP -- the game-changer. Active wrist extension creates passive finger flexion. Do NOT stretch finger flexors in C6 patients.")
