B.aeD=new A.e5("L1-L2","Hip flexors (iliopsoas), hip adductors.","Fully independent.","Fully independent.","Fully independent.","Household to limited community ambulation (bilateral KAFOs + crutches). WC for long distances.","May be neurogenic. Often independent management.","FIM 115-124",B.RR,"Fully Independent",3,null)
