a2=A.d8("A 29-year-old sustains an L1 SCI. Sensory normal through L1. S4-5 LT = 1. DAP present. No VAC. All lower extremity key muscles 0/5. Patient has palpable hip flexor contraction on the right (non-key muscle at L2), but L2 is only 1 level below the motor level.",d3,A.d5(B.ak,A.bt(A.aq(b6,0,b8,c4,A.a2(["S4_5","1"],l,l)),b7,a3,A.aq(b6,0,b8,c4,A.a2(["S4_5","1"],l,l))),a2,B.Y),"inter-10",'Sacral sparing present = incomplete. No VAC. Motor level = L1 (follows sensory). Non-key muscle function at L2 (hip flexor) is only 1 level below the motor level -- NOT more than 3 levels below. The "more than 3 levels below" rule applies to non-key muscles as well. Since motor function is not > 3 levels below the motor level, this is AIS B, not C. Contrast with Case 19 where the non-key muscle was > 3 levels below.',"AIS B Despite Non-Key Muscle (Within 3 Levels)")
