a5=A.d8("A 31-year-old sustains a C8 SCI. No sacral sparing. Below C8, there is scattered sensory and motor function: T1 motor 2/5, T2-T4 LT = 1, left L2 motor 1/5. All other values below injury are 0.",d4,A.d5(B.Y,A.bt(A.aq(b6,0,b8,c7,A.a2(["T1","1","T2","1","T3","1"],l,l)),b7,a6,A.aq(b6,0,b8,c7,A.a2(["T1","1"],l,l))),a5,B.Y),"adv-03","AIS A with zone of partial preservation. ZPP is the most CAUDAL segment with any preserved function, reported separately for each modality and side. Sensory ZPP right: T4 (last level with LT or PP > 0). Sensory ZPP left: T3. Motor ZPP right: T1 (last motor > 0). Motor ZPP left: L2 (left L2 hip flexor = 1/5). ZPP only applies to AIS A injuries.","ZPP Determination with Scattered Function")
